title: Windows release gate covers the history-directory link refusal
description: "Main CI has failed on the Windows aggregate release gate since #126 (1af5990): src/changes.rs:375, the refusal for a linked history directory, is uncovered on Windows, because its only test is Unix-only (symlink). Coverage is 99.99% of regions against the 100% gate."
