acceptance_criteria: "A Windows test replaces the history directory with a directory junction and the adapter refuses with ChangeRefusal::Source; The Windows aggregate release gate passes at 100% coverage"
expected_result: "The Windows release gate reaches 100% coverage, with a Windows test proving a junction cannot redirect history reads."
actual_result: "Windows aggregate run 123163364234: Uncovered Lines src/changes.rs: 375; recipe release-check failed."
